                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The bugaboo has killed a creature within the last round and is adjacent to its corpse</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The bugaboo consumes the creature's soul. The soul is utterly destroyed—nothing short of a @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wish] ritual or similar magic can restore it to life, and only after the bugaboo has been slain. The bogey regains Hit Points equal to double the level of the consumed creature. After devouring six souls within a year, the bogey transforms into a bogeyman.</p>"
                },
